      "entries": [
        "Abbot Tsujon joins her palms together in the shape of a sal flower, evoking the truth that all things eventually decay. In this stance, she can make sal blossom Strikes and is quickened|CRB|quickened 1, and can use the extra action only to cast wholeness of body."
