      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Frequency once per round; Abbot Tsujon makes two Strikes, each of which must be an unarmed Strike or crying temple bell Strike. If both hit the same creature, combine their damage for the purpose of resistances and weaknesses. If either Strike hits and deals damage, the target must succeed at a DC 39 Fortitude save or be stunned|CRB|stunned 1 (or stunned|CRB|stunned 3 on a critical failure); this save has the incapacitation trait."
